peaceful val.\n521\tley of absorbing scenery, where sill\n522\tvery streams and verdant plains make\n523\tup vision of pastoral beauty?\n524\t\n525\t\n526\tYou can choose your resort. any\n527\tthing you want in the Boston e\n528\tNames list of resorts, with hotels and\n529\trates for 1904. This booklet is some\n530\tthing entirely new 1t contains\n531\tbeautiful colored cover and ninety-six\n532\tpages of interesting descriptive mat\n533\tter information and illustrations. 1t\n534\twill be sent free upon receipt of ad-\n535\tdress by the general passenger depart\n536\tment. B. G. VI. R. R., Boston.\n537\t\n538\t=== 49_1895-05-25_p1_sn88056017_00415666718_1895052501_0995.json\n539\tBlackfoot news. (Blackfoot, Idaho) 1891-1902 · 1895-05-25\n540\tcrops: None\n541\theadline: THE PHANTOM\n542\t---\n543\ton MAY TALK\n544\tabout your ortho-\n545\tdox ghost. who\n546\thaunt ancient cas-\n547\tties, wailing and\n548\tgrooming. and car\n549\trying flaming lights\n550\tfrom window to\n551\twindow for appar-\n552\temily no earthly, or\n553\trather unearthly,\n554\tpurpose save that\n555\tOf fat.t,ifyipg ont Of\n556\t\n557\t=== 4_1890-08-11_pna_sn90059522_00175033506_1890081101_0389.json\n558\tSt. Paul daily globe. [volume] (Saint Paul, Minn.) 1884-1896 · 1890-08-11\n559\tcrops: None\n560\theadline: SARATOGA'S OFFERING.\n561\t\n562\tFive Good Races on the Gard for\n563\t\n564\t\n565\tTODAY.\n566\t---\n567\tSARATOGA, N. Y. Aug. 10.-Five\n568\traces, three of them of the short dis\n569\tlance of five furIongs, are scheduled for\n570\tMonday.\n571\t\n572\t\n573\tFirst race, five furlongs- Rainbow, 90:\n574\tDaly-Gypsy 1illy, 90; Dahlia los; Ballyhoo,\n575\t9S Bertelle, 90; Genevieve 100; Keystone,\n576\tno; Ben McCree, 9S; Ofalce los; Carnot,\n577\tITO; Radcliffe, lu3\n578\t\n579\t\n580\tSecond race five furlongs-Princess Annie,\n581\t1UI: Ed Hopper, lO2; Hypocrite, H.; Lady\n582\tlog; King Crab, 10.\n583\t\n584\t\n585\tThird race, two-year-olds, five furlongs-\n586\tAvalon, 10; P