o Spook\", [14], [], \"officers chase a glowing shape that vanishes; genuine ghost or practical joker, not yet known\",\n    place=q(\"north of the railroad track, Reno\", \"north of the track\"),\n    people=[q(\"Officers Leeper and Logan\", \"Officers Leeper and Logan\")],\n    seen=q(\"an uncanny shape in human form with a phosphorescent light around it\", \"an uncanny shape in human form\"),\n    outcome=q(\"unexplained\", \"remains to be seen\"),\n    precision=q(\"town\", \"a Reno Spook\")),\nlabel(\"9_1960-01-20_p14_sn83045462_00280608300_1960012001_0348.json\", \"idiom\", \"a ghost town waiting to die\", [10], [\"E2\"], \"a village buried by lava\"),\nlabel(\"7_1844-09-28_p1_sn82016488_00513688040_1844092801_0313.json\", \"other\", \"violation both of the spirit nnl letter\", [], [], \"a letter on a bank's bonds; spirit in its ordinary sense\"),\nlabel(\"9_1866-03-31_p1_sn84026922_00237288154_1866033101_0364.json\", \"report\", \"Extraordinary Double Apparltion Of Liv-\", [19], [], \"two friends each see the other's apparition on the same night\",\n    place=q(\"a young lady's room in Albany\", \"her friend in Albany\"),\n    people=[q(\"a young lady of the city\", \"a young lady of this city\"), q(\"her friend in St. Louis\", \"resided in st Louis\")],\n    seen=q(\"the well-defined figure of a lady of her acquaintance\", \"well.defned figure of q lady of her ac- quaiEtance\"),\n    outcome=q(\"unexplained\", \"satisfactory explanation of i 's none can be given\"),\n    precision=q(\"town\", \"her friend in Albany\")),\nlabel(\"3_1881-06-04_pna_sn85058130_00206535891_1881060401_0546.json\", \"other\", \"good health and spirits\", [], [], \"brief telegrams\"),\nlabel(\"5_1903-03-28_pna_sn88064111_00280761679_1903032801_0915.json\", \"idiom\", \"Mr.. Mumps now boldly knocks at the dormitory\", [10], [], \"a school column; the mumps knocks\"),\nlabel(\"3_1857-01-16_pna_sn86092535_00202190595_1857011601_0057.json\", \"other\", \"Knocked from under him by the sled\", [13], [], \"street accidents; the knocking is literal\"),\nlabel(\"21_1912-08-01_p1_sn88076432_00271740785_1912080101_0260.json\", \"fiction\", \"Well, hist. mates. and I'll spin y a yarn\", [9, 6, 14], [\"E3\", \"E8\"], \"an old sailor's yarn of a ghost ship, framed as a tale with dialogue\"),\nlabel(\"19_1893-02-03_pna_sn84026918_00295862099_1893020302_0658.json\", \"idiom\", \"laria haunted norass\", [10], [\"E2\"], \"rubber camps; the spirit of discovery and a malaria-haunted swamp\"),\nlabel(\"1_1920-10-07_pna_sn85040437_00414215397_1920100701_0117.json\", \"fiction\", \"SY0pSis. - DIR. John Nicholson,\", [9], [\"E3\"], \"a serial's synopsis\"),\nlabel(\"13_1874-06-12_p1_sn85034076_00200292364_1874061201_0609.json\", \"fiction\", \"Are there reall.. fairies after all ?\", [9], [], \"a fairy story for children\"),\nlabel(\"4_1941-07-27_p1_sn88063294_00414187511_1941072701_0147.json\", \"other\", \"The World Wars Ghost ship\", [17], [\"E8\"], \"a garbled radio report of an Eskimo religious frenzy; the ghost ship is a fragment; crop to check\"),\nlabel(\"18_1903-11-13_p9_sn93053726_00271763517_1903111301_0392.json\", \"other\", \"ghosts are classifedl in seven types\", [6], [], \"a theosophist's types of ghost, in general\"),\n]\nwrite(L, sys.argv[1])\nEOF\ncd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && uv run python $S/labels/g06.py $S/labels/g06.jsonl && uv run python scripts/label_gold.py check $S/labels/g06.jsonl","description":"Write batch 6's labels and check them through checked()","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19943,"cache_read_input_tokens":641758,"output_tokens":9121,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":6756},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19943,"ephem