pers and laborers\")],\n    seen=q(\"a headless horseman with a gigantic axe on his shoulder\", \"hcedless horsemhn, with gigantic axe ON his shoulder\"),\n    outcome=q(\"unexplained\", \"they can not account for the thing\"),\n    specific_place=q(\"the lumber camp on Cheat River\", \"lumber camp ON Cheat river\"),\n    place_type=q(\"other\", \"lumber camp ON Cheat river\"),\n    precision=q(\"building\", \"lumber camp ON Cheat river\")),\nlabel(\"23_1942-12-10_pna_sn88085187_00200291785_1942121001_0706.json\", \"other\", \"resurrected the American fighting spirit\", [], [], \"war commentary; spirit and medium in their ordinary senses\"),\nlabel(\"16_1871-09-01_pna_sn85033019_00414215531_1871090101_0138.json\", \"fiction\", \"BY HENRY W. LONGPELLow.\", [9], [], \"Longfellow's Sandalphon\"),\nlabel(\"13_1922-11-05_p1_sn83045217_00295860832_1922110501_0208.json\", \"advert\", \"for Brunswicks November re leases\", [12, 13], [], \"a record company's releases; Haunting Blues is a title\"),\nlabel(\"13_1935-12-30_p8_sn83045462_00280602632_1935123001_0660.json\", \"fiction\", \"said Senator Sorghum.\", [8], [\"E7\"], \"a quip about Marley's knocker\"),\nlabel(\"10_1913-12-27_pna_sn96076817_00415669513_1913122701_0143.json\", \"fiction\", \"SYNOPSIS.\", [9], [\"E3\", \"E5\"], \"a serial; a trance medium detective\"),\nlabel(\"6_1826-11-04_pna_sn83021391_00340588010_1826110401_0124.json\", \"fiction\", \"WINTERS TALE.\", [8, 9], [\"E7\"], \"a mock-sentimental poem, Smollett's, with sheeted ghosts\"),\nlabel(\"8_1874-06-23_p1_sn84026788_00202192348_1874062301_0104.json\", \"other\", \"a proper and suitable medium of exchange\", [], [], \"a letter against gold money\"),\nlabel(\"12_1904-05-19_pna_sn89064489_00393340253_1904051901_0167.json\", \"fiction\", \"sion of Middleton's story\", [9, 6], [\"E3\"], \"a yarn of a ghostly arm and a bottle that turns iron to gold\"),\nlabel(\"1_1868-12-03_pna_sn84027398_00279529418_1868120301_0611.json\", \"advert\", \"Nop is the time to subscribe for 1869!\", [12, 13], [], \"a magazine's puff; Perfidious Planchette is a story's title\"),\nlabel(\"7_1891-05-02_pna_sn82014635_00237286716_1891050201_0472.json\", \"fiction\", \"Stolberg or his unhappy victim\", [9, 3], [], \"the end of a tale of a mesmerist's abduction; the seance is mesmeric\"),\nlabel(\"7_1866-06-26_pna_sn85025007_00415663596_1866062601_0202.json\", \"advert\", \"Invites attention to his very extensive and choice stock of\", [12], [], \"a grocer's advertisement; Jamaica spirits\"),\nlabel(\"44_1896-12-18_pna_sn89060092_00279521894_1896121801_0410.json\", \"advert\", \"Ayers Sarsaparilla\", [12], [\"E4\"], \"a patent medicine advertisement\"),\nlabel(\"7_1903-03-01_p1_sn84020274_00294559589_1903030101_0039.json\", \"report\", \"Acting upon what he believes to be a message from the spirit world\", [], [], \"a first-person claim to have conversed with spirits, who advised a new church\",\n    people=[q(\"J. O. Stephens\", \"J. o. Stephens\")],\n    seen=q(\"conversed with spirits in the spirit land\", \"he has conversed with spirits in the spirit land\"),\n    outcome=q(\"unknown\", \"bc- erect cd next wear\")),\nlabel(\"3_1926-11-23_p3_sn82014519_00414219731_1926112301_0419.json\", \"report\", \"released for publication a message received by medium in Attleboro\", [5], [\"E5\"], \"a medium's message claimed from Houdini; cut off in the archive\",\n    place=q(\"Attleboro, Massachusetts\", \"Attleboro, Mass\"),\n    place_state=q(\"Massachusetts\", \"Attleboro, Mass\"),\n    people=[q(\"a medium in Attleboro\", \"medium in Attleboro, Mass\"), q(\"Mrs. Beatrice Houdini\", \"Mrs. Beatrice Houdini\")],\n    seen=q(\"a message from Houdini, trying to get in touch with this world\", \"the attempt of Hou- dini 10 get in touch with this world\"),\n    outcome=q(\"unknown\", \"The medium. who asked\"),\n    precision=q(\"town\", \"Attleboro, Mass\")),\nlabel(\"7_1894-05-31_pna_sn85033255_00514152536_1894053101_0085.json\", \"idiom\", \"He make