question all\n308\tover fOr that's the way it was in the\n309\tbook and then hitch the answer to it,\n310\tand which all put together made this:\n311\t\"The benefits which in this life do either\n312\taccompany or flow from justification,\n313\tadoption and sanctifcatiOn are peace of\n314\tconscience, joy in the Holy Ghost, in\n315\tcrease of grace, and perseverance there\n316\tin to the end'-I thought the child was\n317\tthe greatest wonder I'd ever seen in all\n318\tmy life. She tuck it right through, too,\n319\twithout balkin' or misSin' the first word.\n320\tAnd she spoke so sweet and she looked so\n321\tlike little angel that before l knOwed\n322\tit the tears were runnin' down my\n323\tcheeks as big as buckshot. I've seen the\n324\tday when l could have mauled and split\n325\tthOusan' rails quicker and easier than\n326\t] could have larnt that thing and said\n327\t1t off like she did.\n328\t\n329\t\n330\t''NOw, my brethren, that child didn't\n331\tunderstand or know the meanin' of one\n332\tword O. that. 1t put me up to all knew\n333\tto take it in myself. But just let that\n334\tPresbyterian young one grow up, and\n335\tevery word of that catecism will come\n336\tback to her, and her character will stiff\n337\tfen up under it, and she'll have the\n338\tbackbone of the matter in her for life.\n339\t\n340\t\n341\t\"NOw, / can't put things into nay chill\n342\tdren that way. NOthin' don't stay, any\n343\thow. It's like drivin' nail into a rot\n344\tten log\"\n345\t\n346\t\n347\tThis last remark l never forget. For\n348\t80 years afterward, as would stand at\n349\tthe blackboard trying to fix rules and\n350\tprinciples in the mind of the dull pupil,\n351\tthis remark would come back to me\n352\twith its peculiar pertinenency.\n353\t\n354\t=== 8_1903-04-09_pna_sn82016014_00295871088_1903040901_0082.json\n355\tThe Topeka state journal. [volume] (Topeka, Kansas) 1892-1980 · 1903-04-09\n356\tcrops: cached\n357\theadline: FUNK WANTS A BOUNCER.\n358\t\n359\tBesieged by